        "body": "Wills, deeds, licenses, newspapers, pamphlets, almanacs, playing cards, dice. It touched almost everyone, and it landed hardest on the people who could complain the loudest: lawyers, printers, merchants. Unlike old duties which claimed to steer trade, this one had a single purpose. Raise revenue.",
