        "title": "AP Q1",
        "body": "Three questions, AP-shaped. Say your answer before I give it. One: a stimulus hands you the Stamp Act Congress's Declaration of Rights and Grievances. Only representatives chosen by the colonists can tax them. What principle is the Congress asserting, and what line did Parliament invent to answer it?",
